fr:mainmatter.html:ul:
ε ⟹ true; ⊥, char a ⟹ false;

_·_ ⟹ conjunction;

_⊕_ ⟹ disjunction;

_* ⟹ true;

μ ⟹ decide on the body under a freshly nullable
    recursive occurrence; the productivity side condition from
    CFGDesc makes this terminating.

fr:mainmatter.html:p:
Two independent factors. Lossy unification gives 16× (213→13s);
explicit refl on top of lossy gives an additional 2× (13→6.2s). With
lossy off, refl buys only ~5 percent. So:
